  <!--
    1.12.257 -> 1.12.258, UNIT 296 TASK 7, UNDER HM-DEC-150. A PATCH: no src/ file changed and the
    product is step 1's one nice-to-pass criterion, re-drawn. It was the named drop candidate and it
